WEBVTT - Server Room B: Episode 1 Part 2 - Reality Uninstall (Story by Abhrankan Chakrabarti)

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:07.500
The server hum has changed. Instead of a smooth mechanical drone, it now stutters like a broken audio file.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:14.500
Abhrankan slowly rises from his chair. He reaches for his phone... and freezes.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:22.500
Behind his hand hangs a trail. Not motion blur, but solid frozen copies lingering in the air.

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:29.500
The security keypad isn't asking for a passcode anymore. It races through endless system messages.

00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:38.000
The wall flickers, vanishing into an infinite black void. The universe wasn't being haunted. It was being uninstalled.

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:45.500
A deep rumble shakes the room. His workstation monitor flashes violently, casting a blinding strobe pattern.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:53.500
The terminal is compiling a new process. And the hardware it's using to build it... is Abhrankan's own brain.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
SERVER ROOM B — Chapter 1: Out of Memory (Part 2)
Story by Abhrankan Chakrabarti | TO BE CONTINUED
